Error [jet.MoveWithoutMarker]: `t` is passed to `both` more than once in this call
  --> tests/ui/implicit_take_twice_in_call.jet:5:16
    |
  5 |     print(both(t, t))
    |                ^
 Why: A name used in two arguments of one call has no last use in that call, so `both` can't take `t` there
 Fix: Write `t.copy()` in the argument that keeps a copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0209

